			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\nThere are four gas valves that when turned on, activates a blue fire torch outside of the mansion.\n\nThe valves can be located on the following rooms:\n- [[Apple Orchard.canvas|Apple Orchard]]\n- [[Gemstone Cavern.canvas|Gemstone Cavern]]\n- [[Hovel.canvas|Hovel]]\n- [[Schoolhouse.canvas|Schoolhouse]]\n\nThis unlocks an Elevator that leads to [[The Precipice.canvas|The Precipice]]",
